/// known-gap: interp takes only a plain number after `offset`
/// The change after `offset` is any number expression, read whole with the
/// usual precedence.
<>P |
    n: 0
xx
link P trust -100...100
a <> P | n: 1
b <> P | n: 2
amount | 4
a link to b on trust offset 2 * amount
say(:link_score(a, b, "trust"))
a link to b on trust offset -amount + 1
say(:link_score(a, b, "trust"))
a link to b on trust offset +.5
say(:link_score(a, b, "trust"))
a link to b on trust offset -10 for 3 ticks
say(:link_score(a, b, "trust"))
